</td></tr></table><p class="fallback" style="margin:0 0 20px;padding:16px;background:#eef0ed;color:#172b26;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all"><a class="fallback" href="https://app.example.test/auth/v1/verify?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa&amp;type=signup&amp;redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.example.test%2F" style="color:#172b26;text-decoration:underline;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-all">https://app.example.test/auth/v1/verify?token=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa&amp;type=signup&amp;redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fapp.example.test%2F</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:16px 0;color:#56635e;font-size:14px;line-height:21px">Si no fuiste tú, ignora este correo.</p></td></tr><tr><td class="footer" style="padding:20px 32px 28px;background:#ffffff"><p class="copy" style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#172b26;font-size:16px;line-height:24px">Saludos,<br>Cuadrao</p><p class="muted" style="margin:0;color:#56635e;font-size:14px;line-height:21px">¿Necesitas ayuda? Escríbenos a <a href="mailto:hola@cuadrao.ai" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline">hola@cuadrao.ai</a></p><p class="muted" style="margin:16px 0;color:#56635e;font-size:14px;line-height:21px">Cuadrao LLC</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>"
